STATUS: NONEXECUTABLE IMPLEMENTATION PSEUDOCODE. NOT AN ADA PATCH.
BASE: spark2014 b9410c6ed36d4e69a6c4d31e152fa8facaf0235c.
Only fresh function results; ordinary Adjust/copy remains unsupported.

interface Plan_Fresh_Region(Prefix_Node, Scope_Node, Exact_Type):
    require Prefix_Node is the exact evaluated allocating function result
    require Exact_Type is strict Finalizable (Relaxed_Finalization=False)
    require full type and actual Finalize entity are visible in SPARK
    require Finalize's real body/effects, termination and safety are covered
    require generated normal-compiler schedule needs no unmodelled Adjust
    reject dispatch, unknown finalizers or unsupported nested ownership
    return Region {
        creation_node, region_end, type, finalize_entity,
        physical_owner_reference, logical_complete_value_identifier,
        exact_cleanup_edges, original_leak_sites
    }
No type-name-only exemption. This object is translator state, not runtime
metadata, a cleanup theorem, a proved Boolean, or application authority.

interface Bind_Fresh_Region(Region, Initializer_Program, Continuation):
    # All Initializer_Program preconditions/RTE/effects remain.
    let physical_value = Initializer_Program in
    let physical_owner_reference = own_ref(physical_value) in
    let logical_complete_value_identifier = complete_value(physical_value) in
    try
        Continuation
    finally
        invoke_real_proved_Finalize(physical_owner_reference)
        emit_original_No_Memory_Leaks_VC(physical_owner_reference)
        emit_each_deferred_original_call_leak_VC_at_its_original_location
    end
The initializer is outside its own try/finally. Failure before it returns
creates no completed caller owner and must not finalize an uninitialized
object. The already enclosing region still performs its cleanup.
own_ref and complete_value denote existing concrete Why typed-ref/value
builders after exact APIs are inspected; neither is a new trusted function.
The complete value is not a hash, pointer equality, alias to a mutable native
head, manual snapshot-death protocol or substitute scalar contract.

Example two fresh Old captures A then B:
    let owner_A = Capture(A_args) in
    try
        let owner_B = Capture(B_args) in
        try
            original_body_and_all_postchecks(original_full_Old_A,
                                              original_full_Old_B)
        finally
            actual_Finalize(owner_B);
            original_leak_VCs_for_B
        end
    finally
        actual_Finalize(owner_A);
        original_leak_VCs_for_A
    end
B initializer failure finalizes A, not uninitialized B. A postcheck failure
finalizes B then A. Successful return does the same cleanup after checks.
Variable-free Capture("x")'Old still receives a physical region even if the
existing logical Transform_Attribute_Old optimization ignores Old.

The existing mapping overload2742..2773 iterates a Node_Sets.Set and nests
bindings around its continuation. Its iteration/nesting order is not an
attestation of actual native prefix creation/finalization order. Obtain the
actual prefix elaboration plan, or prove that disjoint no-raise cleanup
commutes and covers every permitted order. Do not merge equal call owners.
The smallest first implementation may support exactly one fresh prefix per
translated region, keeping multiple-prefix refusal until that proof exists.

