At exact FSF Transform_Function_Call static leak branch24008..24030:
    if original_static_leak_condition:
        if exact Expr_Node has fresh-region context AND the generated program
           is structurally enclosed by that region:
            record one deferred VC_Resource_Leak with original location/kind
